    <item>
      <title></title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/gdd_design/ui_ux/ux_flows.html</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/gdd_design/ui_ux/ux_flows.html</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;h1&gt;UX Flows &amp;amp; Wireframes&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../README.md&#34;&gt;← Back to Index&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;./Visual_Style.md&#34;&gt;Visual Style →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🧭 User Journey Map&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;-user-journey-map&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#-user-journey-map&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Session Flow (The &amp;ldquo;Happy Path&amp;rdquo;)&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;session-flow-the-happy-path&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#session-flow-the-happy-path&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;pre class=&#34;mermaid hx:mt-6&#34;&gt;
  graph TD
    Start(App Launch) --&amp;gt; Login{Auth Check}
    Login -- New User --&amp;gt; Tutorial[Tutorial Mission]
    Login -- Returning --&amp;gt; MainMenu[Main Menu]
    Tutorial --&amp;gt; MainMenu
    
    MainMenu --&amp;gt; Prep[Preparation Phase]
    Prep --&amp;gt;|Select Loadout| LoadoutUI
    LoadoutUI --&amp;gt;|Ready| Matchmaking
    
    Matchmaking --&amp;gt; Loading{Loading Level}
    Loading --&amp;gt; Spawn[In-Raid Gameplay]
    
    Spawn --&amp;gt;|Death| DefeatScreen
    Spawn --&amp;gt;|Extraction| VictoryScreen
    
    DefeatScreen --&amp;gt; Summary[After Action Report]
    VictoryScreen --&amp;gt; Summary
    
    Summary --&amp;gt; MainMenu
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;📱 Key Screen Wireframes&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;-key-screen-wireframes&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#-key-screen-wireframes&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;1. Main Menu (Hub)&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;1-main-menu-hub&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#1-main-menu-hub&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Goal:&lt;/strong&gt; Quick access to &amp;ldquo;Play&amp;rdquo; while showing progression.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;#43;--------------------------------------------------&amp;#43;
| [Profile Lvl 12]                   [Currency $$] |
|                                                  |
|      [ 3D OPERATOR MODEL - CENTER STAGE ]        |
|                                                  |
|                   [ PLAY ]                       |
|             (Pulsing Action Button)              |
|                                                  |
| [LOADOUT]      [TRADERS]      [HIDEOUT]    [XXX] |
|                                                  |
| [Battle Pass]                        [Social/Friends] |
&amp;#43;--------------------------------------------------&amp;#43;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button
    class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50&#34;
    title=&#34;Copy code&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Action:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;[PLAY]&lt;/code&gt; must be the largest element.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secondary:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;Loadout&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Traders&lt;/code&gt; are most frequent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tertiary:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;Hideout&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Social&lt;/code&gt; can be smaller icons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;2. Inventory Management (The &amp;ldquo;Tetris&amp;rdquo;)&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;2-inventory-management-the-tetris&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#2-inventory-management-the-tetris&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Goal:&lt;/strong&gt; Efficient sorting and equipping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;#43;--------------------------------------------------&amp;#43;
| &amp;lt; Back          STASH (10x30)           [Sort ▼] |
|--------------------------------------------------|
| [  ][  ][  ][  ][  ][  ]  |  [EQUIPPED SLOT]     |
| [  ][Rifle ][  ][  ][  ]  |  &amp;#43;----------------&amp;#43;  |
| [  ][      ][  ][  ][  ]  |  |   PRIMARY      |  |
| [  ][  ][  ][  ][  ][  ]  |  |    [AK-47]     |  |
| [  ][Medkit][  ][  ][  ]  |  &amp;#43;----------------&amp;#43;  |
|                           |  [HELMET] [ARMOR]    |
| [DRAG ITEM HERE TO EQUIP] |  [RIG]    [BACKPACK] |
&amp;#43;--------------------------------------------------&amp;#43;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button
    class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50&#34;
    title=&#34;Copy code&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interaction:&lt;/strong&gt; Drag &amp;amp; Drop is primary. Double-tap to quick equip.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt; Valid slots highlight Green. Invalid slots (wrong type) highlight Red.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;3. Looting Interface (In-Game)&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;3-looting-interface-in-game&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#3-looting-interface-in-game&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Goal:&lt;/strong&gt; Speed vs. Risk. Looting blocks visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code&#34;&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;#43;--------------------------------------------------&amp;#43;
| (Blurred Game Background)        [X] CLOSE       |
|                                                  |
| CONTAINER: Dead Scav         YOUR INVENTORY      |
| &amp;#43;-------------------&amp;#43;       &amp;#43;-------------------&amp;#43;|
| | [Pistol] [Ammo]   |   &amp;gt;&amp;gt;  | [Rifle  ] [Med]   ||
| | [Key   ] [    ]   |       | [       ] [   ]   ||
| &amp;#43;-------------------&amp;#43;       &amp;#43;-------------------&amp;#43;|
|                                                  |
| [LOOT ALL] (Hold)           Weight: 24.5kg       |
&amp;#43;--------------------------------------------------&amp;#43;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button
    class=&#34;hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50&#34;
    title=&#34;Copy code&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tension Element:&lt;/strong&gt; The UI covers 70% of the screen. The player is blind to movement while looting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quick Action:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ldquo;Loot All&amp;rdquo; button has a 1-second hold timer to prevent accidental clicks and simulate &amp;ldquo;gathering&amp;rdquo; time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🔄 Interaction States&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;-interaction-states&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#-interaction-states&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Button States&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;button-states&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#button-states&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Normal:&lt;/strong&gt; Default color/opacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pressed:&lt;/strong&gt; 90% scale + Haptic feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disabled:&lt;/strong&gt; 50% opacity, Grayscale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Selected:&lt;/strong&gt; Highlight border + Glow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Feedback Loop&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;feedback-loop&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#feedback-loop&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Positive Action:&lt;/strong&gt; Green flash or Gold outline (e.g., Successfully equipping an item).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negative Action:&lt;/strong&gt; Red shake animation (e.g., Trying to equip a Primary weapon in a Secondary slot).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process:&lt;/strong&gt; Spinner/Progress bar for long actions (e.g., Searching a body).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;

      </description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title></title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/gdd_design/ui_ux/visual_style.html</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/gdd_design/ui_ux/visual_style.html</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        &lt;h1&gt;Visual Style &amp;amp; Art Guidelines&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;../README.md&#34;&gt;← Back to Index&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;./UX_Flows.md&#34;&gt;UX Flows ←&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🎨 Visual Identity&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;-visual-identity&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#-visual-identity&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Style:&lt;/strong&gt; Grounded Neo-Industrial
&lt;strong&gt;Era:&lt;/strong&gt; Post-Collapse (Near Future 2035)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Design Philosophy&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;design-philosophy&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#design-philosophy&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decay with Memory:&lt;/strong&gt; Every rusted panel was once new. Every ruin was a home. The world is &lt;em&gt;overgrown&lt;/em&gt;, not just dirty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tactical Clarity:&lt;/strong&gt; Gameplay elements (cover, loot, enemies) must be instantly readable against the chaotic background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Fashion:&lt;/strong&gt; Gear looks practical. No glowing magical armor. Duct tape, zip ties, and worn metal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🌈 Global Color Palette&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;-global-color-palette&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#-global-color-palette&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Primary Game Colors (Interactive)&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;primary-game-colors-interactive&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#primary-game-colors-interactive&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Used for UI and Gameplay Feedback.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Role&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Color Name&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Hex&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Usage&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Friendly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Tactical Blue&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;#3B82F6&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Minimap Markers, Squad HUD&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hostile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Critical Red&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;#EF4444&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Enemy Highlights, Damage Indicators&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Loot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Neon Yellow&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;#FACC15&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Interactive Objects, Pickup Prompts&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Signal Green&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;#22C55E&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Mission Markers, Exfil Zones&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Neutral&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Steel Gray&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;#6B7280&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;HUD Backgrounds, Non-Interactive UI&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Environmental Base (Atmospheric)&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;environmental-base-atmospheric&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#environmental-base-atmospheric&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Used for Level Design and Lighting.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Category&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Color&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Usage&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industrial&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Rust Orange (&lt;code&gt;#D97706&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Metal structures, decaying machinery&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Urban&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Concrete Gray (&lt;code&gt;#94A3B8&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Buildings, roads, rubble&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nature&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Overgrowth Green (&lt;code&gt;#166534&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Vines, moss reclaiming the city&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lighting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Sodium Vapor (&lt;code&gt;#FBBF24&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Streetlights, old factory lamps&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Darkness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Shadow Blue (&lt;code&gt;#1E293B&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Deep shadows (contrast with light)&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🔠 Typography&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;-typography&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#-typography&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Primary Font: &lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;Oxanium&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; (Google Fonts)&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;primary-font--google-fonts&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#primary-font--google-fonts&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Usage:&lt;/em&gt; Headings, UI Headers, Important Stats.
&lt;em&gt;Style:&lt;/em&gt; Cyber-Tech but legible. Square shapes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Secondary Font: &lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;Inter&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; (Google Fonts)&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;secondary-font--google-fonts&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#secondary-font--google-fonts&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Usage:&lt;/em&gt; Body text, Item descriptions, Dialogue.
&lt;em&gt;Style:&lt;/em&gt; Clean, sans-serif, highly readable at small sizes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Font Hierarchy&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;font-hierarchy&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#font-hierarchy&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;H1 (Screen Title):&lt;/strong&gt; 48px, Bold, Uppercase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;H2 (Section Header):&lt;/strong&gt; 32px, Semi-Bold.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Body (Descriptions):&lt;/strong&gt; 16px, Regular.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Micro (Stats):&lt;/strong&gt; 12px, Mono-spaced (for numbers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🖼️ Iconography Style&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;-iconography-style&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#-iconography-style&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Style:&lt;/strong&gt; Flat, Simplified Vectors. No gradients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stroke:&lt;/strong&gt; 2px consistent stroke width.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fill:&lt;/strong&gt; Transparent or solid depending on state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metaphor:&lt;/strong&gt; Real-world objects (e.g., a &amp;ldquo;Medkit&amp;rdquo; icon looks like a military IFAK, not a generic cross).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Icon Set Examples&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;icon-set-examples&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#icon-set-examples&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weapon:&lt;/strong&gt; Silhouette of an AK-47 (Specific, not generic &amp;ldquo;gun&amp;rdquo;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Armor:&lt;/strong&gt; Plate Carrier vest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ammo:&lt;/strong&gt; Specific caliber bullet shape (5.56 vs 9mm).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Cross inside a tactical pouch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💡 Lighting Design (Readability)&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;-lighting-design-readability&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#-lighting-design-readability&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The game is Top-Down, so lighting is critical for depth perception.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rim Lighting:&lt;/strong&gt; All characters must have a subtle rim light (fresnel) to pop from the background.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Player:&lt;/em&gt; Cyan rim light.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Enemy:&lt;/em&gt; Red rim light (subtle).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Silhouette:&lt;/strong&gt; Props must have clean outlines. Avoid visually noisy textures on the ground that confuse character movement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contrast:&lt;/strong&gt; Playable areas are 20% brighter than non-playable areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;

      </description>
